{"product":{"id":8476523692371,"title":"SYSTEM 4 OIL CURE SCALP TREATMENT O","body_html":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOIL CURE SCALP TREATMENT O BY SYSTEM 4\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTherapeutic, exfoliating and caring scalp mask\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eOil Cure Scalp Treatment Mask is specially formulated to ensure the well-being of the scalp. It gently exfoliates the scalp while removing dandruff, grease and hair residue. Moisturizes, relieves itching and scalp irritation. Can also be used as a conditioner for hair lenghts. The product moisturizes the hair and gives it shine. Contains salicylic acid, which acts as an exfoliating ingredient. Product is not suitable for children under 3 years of age.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eBENEFITS:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eGently exfoliates the scalp\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSoothes itchy and irritated scalp\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eMoisturizes hair and scalp\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eMakes hair shiny beautifully\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eParfume free and dermatologically tested\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe tube is made of 50% recycled plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUSAGE:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eApply mask to washed scalp and rub lightly with fingertips in a circular motion. If desired, add to the length of the hair. Leave on for 5-30 minutes and rinse well.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003epH 3.0\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Rempire Tower Shop","product_type":"Scalp mask","created_at":"2023-07-19T18:08:16+03:00","handle":"sim-sensitive-system-4-oil-cure-sc